  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Welcome to Barefoot Blues – Your Seagrove Beach Getaway<br><br>Tucked away on a quiet street just two houses from the sand, Barefoot Blues offers private deeded beach access, views of beautiful Eastern Lake, and plenty of space for your crew to spread out and relax. With 4 bedrooms, 4.5 baths, and sleeping space for up to 14 guests, it’s a perfect fit for families or groups of friends.<br><br>You’re just a short walk to the water and minutes from Greenway Station for dining, coffee, and shopping. Two neighborhood pools (including one that’s heated) make it even easier to unwind.<br><br>What You’ll Love:<br>\t•\tPrivate deeded beach access – just steps away<br>\t•\tSpacious, open-concept layout with multiple indoor & outdoor living areas<br>\t•\t3rd-floor lookout tower with private porch<br>\t•\tBuilt-in bunk room that sleeps 6<br>\t•\tGourmet kitchen with granite countertops and seating for 11<br>\t•\tBlackstone grill for easy outdoor meals<br>\t•\tOutdoor shower<br>\t•\tSmart TVs in every bedroom<br>\t•\t8+ beach chairs, 2 umbrellas, 8 towels, and cooler included<br>\t•\tAccess to 2 community pools (1 heated)<br>\t•\tPack ’n Play and air mattress available<br>\t•\tParking for 2 vehicles in the driveway<br><br>Sleeping Arrangements:<br><br>Second Floor<br>– Primary Suite: King bed + en suite bath<br>– Bedroom 2: Queen bed + en suite bath<br>– Bedroom 3 (Bunk Room): Two twin-over-full bunks (sleeps 6) + en suite bath<br><br>Third Floor<br>– Bedroom 4: Queen bed + en suite bath + private balcony<br><br>Everything you need for a laid-back 30A vacation is right here—from morning coffee on the porch to sunset walks on the sand.<br><br>⸻<br><br>Things to Know Before You Book:<br>\t•\tWe provide a starter supply of toilet paper, paper towels, trash bags, and detergent pods.<br>\t•\tCheck-in: 4:00 PM | Check-out: 9:00 AM<br>\t•\tEarly check-in/late check-out may be available—just ask<br>\t•\tSmoking is strictly prohibited<br>\t•\tMaximum occupancy is enforced<br>\t•\tPrimary renter must be 25+ or accompanied by a parent/legal guardian<br>\t•\tLonger nightly minimums may apply on weekends/holidays<br>\t•\tAny damage during your stay will be charged to the booking guest<br>\t•\tThe owner/host is not responsible for personal injury or damage",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "New List-4BR all en-suite steps to deeded beach and 2 community ‘1 heated’ pools"
        }
